fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|Charges}}
*** Mirana begins the game {{M|innate|text=innately|x}} with {{#explode:{{#var:Celestial Quiver charges}}|/}} [[charges]], and the ability has a max level of {{#expr:trunc(30/{{#var:Celestial Quiver type1 value2}})+1}}.
*** Celestial Quiver levels up, grants, and increases the max charge count correspondingly every {{#var:Celestial Quiver type1 value2}} hero levels.
*** This ability is in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows upon {{M|projectile}} impact:
*# The {{M|magical}} {{M|attack damage}} bonus.
*# Mirana's attack instance.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Magical}} {{M|attack damage}}: {{Code|{{#var:Celestial Quiver value1}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Mirana|v3l}}|tal|x}} + {{#var:Celestial Quiver basic1}} × SelfLvl}}
** {{M|Charges}}: {{Code|{{#var:Celestial Quiver charges}} + [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]] SelfLvl / {{#var:Celestial Quiver type1 value2}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions⌋|⌉]]}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Celestial Quiver icon0}}
| desc = When a charge is available, Mirana's next attack will deal bonus magic damage.
}}

