{{Rootnotes
| name = Leap
| desc = [[Root]] sources do not interrupt the ability if already leaping forward.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Charges}}
** Grants all {{#var:Leap charges}} [[charges]] immediately upon learning Leap.
** {{cf|shdnotes}} The {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Leap charges shd}}-{{#var:Leap charges}}}}|shd}} charges.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Interrupts Mirana's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
*#* {{Symbol|Caster|Leap}}
*#** Grants all ability effects upon cast.
*#** The leap duration varies depending on the terrain.
*#** Can leap over other units and {{M|impassable terrain}}.
*#** Applies a non-disabling {{M|upward movement}}, and leaps at {{#var:Leap basic1}}-speed over {{#expr:{{#var:Leap value1}}/{{#var:Leap basic1}} round2}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Leap value1 tal}}/{{#var:Leap basic1}} round2}}|10tal}}) seconds.
*#* {{Symbol|Turn Rate|Lock}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#** Locks Mirana's {{M|facing angle}}.
*#** Can only attack or cast {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} targeted abilities in the direction she is facing.
*#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|mirana_leap_buff}}
*#** Reapplying the buff refreshes the duration.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Leap icon0}}
| desc = Mirana leaps forward into battle, empowering herself with a ferocious roar that grants bonus attack and movement speed. Speed bonus lasts 5 seconds.
}}

